commit 6c6b45823e59d54e00bba318d840e65a14bdc4f8
Author: Wai Hon Law <whhone@google.com>
Date:   Thu Sep 10 18:30:27 2026 -0700

    refactor: normalize message content to multimodal parts in model data processors
    
    Message content in prompt template inputs was previously allowed to be either a
    string or an array of multimodal parts. This caused data processors to perform
    ad-hoc unwrapping of arrays to strings.
    
    Add NormalizeContent and NormalizeMessageContent utilities in data_utils.{h,cc}.
    Provide a default virtual implementation of MessageToTemplateInput in
    ModelDataProcessor that normalizes message content to multimodal parts
    ([{"type": "text", "text": "..."}]). Remove duplicate MessageToTemplateInput
    implementations from generic, fastvlm, qwen3, minicpm5, gemma4, lfm2, and
    tiny_gemma processors. Retain custom tool-formatting overrides in gemma3 and
    function_gemma data processors, delegating non-tool messages to the base class.
    Update unit tests accordingly.
    
    LiteRT-LM-PiperOrigin-RevId: 979509692

